      "VOUT = 0.6 V x (1 + R1 / R2): 200k / 100k gives 1.8 V (the datasheet's figure); 453k / 100k gives 3.3 V, 220k / 100k 1.92 V.",
      "From one Li-ion cell or a 5 V rail; at 100 % duty it passes the input through when the input falls near the output.",
